[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19268.39, "timestamp": "05:21:08", "text": "哇。再買一些。  哦，我死了。兄弟，這條鯊魚。 1馬力。 1馬力。 1馬力。他沒死，兄弟。他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19270.55, "timestamp": "05:21:10", "text": "就像一個HP"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19277.99, "timestamp": "05:21:17", "text": "是什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19304.75, "timestamp": "05:21:44", "text": "我的天啊。但我感覺這裡也有點像工作台。不，我或許是對的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19307.59, "timestamp": "05:21:47", "text": "。不，不。"}]